 "943684058151291", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_943684064817957_2254751309337931764_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ck7Ov76zDqYQ7kNvwGht5eI&_nc_oc=Ado-ZeBYkQsAG_QhBDOiF9LWun0jtPqhDiRqgdjON_9EW2d_YGFT-nKKQuEFdSBNElE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5arjoxqJfET6WaxSSOpj4TUOrJkiTU28M2uN2g98cDww&oe=6A0B088E"}]}, "id": "1158403202958317", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1650835902930864", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1650835909597530_7698794668934931366_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c9UBENYMTSkQ7kNvwEZU6iz&_nc_oc=AdpURlXothfWMAt1-SfIomyLMdcgxNKLO5d2sDAm_8ZOPR5Rul494r_hsH89bU1-dsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6jLgOCne5So6QZnA0qCd-dUptsPQ1PFOwW3aJ34rRPPQ&oe=6A0B122E"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2141295170041059", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314634_2141295173374392_5142446005972553003_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VAElpi28bKMQ7kNvwE8Y9zG&_nc_oc=Adr1RNXEdUbYCyYL4ILrrE-oRjsAuDBzHWXb6DWiPaycI2X85y3GnkssQEPH4jzw3rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af47Wbm8mXueFDM8SzgwFEhe5ZZkGL-rf92SvxMoUYB2mg&oe=6A0B2B62"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1966963364242425", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_1966963367575758_7602976987452093628_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gZ1_meRkj-YQ7kNvwHgVNas&_nc_oc=Adq-5IOVwwmaORrA4XbHNE3oXSBKsk7RHADTIO8OlnB5eg0bNFfNMRQaeAiHLjOi764&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4H1KGi0cVWqEAVVgOFuv943eWWWvyE74NXMPTLaPk0JQ&oe=6A0B1CF1"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1487646096060204", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1487646099393537_3581322408804862552_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GhP0pn7CkM4Q7kNvwFrXHZD&_nc_oc=AdoARKaJ2oWkqAwxHUFnnhSJ6EPEikf5ViE3tethUDCmMnGK5ThNNUenaXqjGopVkEM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5IpyjQhzrg7nF759RMEQXTRgaZ_LyTx4j1lPIHeZW8jQ&oe=6A0B36FC"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "977195188305857", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_977195194972523_3268893696008516125_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mSCbahbgJ9YQ7kNvwFc78KL&_nc_oc=AdqadNEwp9f-P89HUurwr4v5X2h8PTXCZbNzq6siXlWulOoxgzyaSiGyWV5acuKL864&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5NOLLoom0YYt_4edofeU15L0ggF6HhQ9zRM5tYA3XhbQ&oe=6A0B360C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videoCover.png", "id": "880090948185547", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_880090951518880_3964157107066797762_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RWXbExWUjLAQ7kNvwF6ABgo&_nc_oc=Adpt0_wgDbYIyClyqpDQzPY2aLPWVhHp8iuQZvY7_XAFY4cqYFUTeUDe_cGqLOt7EyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af79DUtvJ7bJwC4NAlAgcIPHD7HHW-NDzGQ4dtGgz5PQKg&oe=6A0B01DE"}, "display_name": "Zumbi Shooter: Arcade Waves", "keywords": ["shooter", "arcade", "zombie"], "long_description": "\ud83e\udddf The apocalypse has begun\u2026 and the clock is ticking \ud83e\udddf\n\n\ud83d\udca5 Step into a fast-paced VR arcade zombie shooter built for pure adrenaline! Fight through relentless waves of the undead using dual-wield weapons, lightning-fast reflexes, and smart positioning to survive as long as possible \ud83d\udca5\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f Every match is a race against time. The clock is always running out, and the only way to stay alive is to eliminate zombies to gain precious extra seconds. The longer you survive, the more chaotic and dangerous the battlefield becomes \u23f1\ufe0f\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Face multiple types of enemies, each with unique behaviors that constantly challenge your strategy. Adapt quickly, react fast, and stay focused as the pressure keeps rising \ud83e\udde0\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Battle across several unique maps, each with its own atmosphere and challenges. Earn money by defeating zombies and unlock new locations as you push deeper into the apocalypse \ud83c\udf0d\n\n\ud83d\ude81 Unleash powerful random power-ups and call in military support including air strikes, attack helicopters, and robotic turrets to turn the tide when the horde becomes overwhelming \ud83d\ude81\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Uncover a gripping hidden story as you play, piecing together cryptic transmissions, classified documents, and buried secrets that reveal the truth behind the apocalypse \ud83e\udde9\n\n\ud83d\udd25 With escalating waves, intense VR gunplay, and nonstop arcade action, survival is never guaranteed \ud83d\udd25\n\n\ud83d\udc80 Shoot fast. Think faster. Survive the apocalypse \ud83d\udc80", "short_description": "\ud83e\udddf The apocalypse has begun. Time is running out. You are the last line of defense.\n\nJump into a fast-paced VR arcade zombie shooter on Meta Quest. Wield dual weapons, fight through relentless hordes, collect devastating power-ups, and call in military support while the clock keeps ticking.\n\nEvery second counts: eliminate zombies, gain extra time, and survive increasingly brutal waves.\n\nShoot. Survive. Resist the apocalypse. \ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tuningmaniaprivacypolicy.wordpress.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tuning Mania", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://zumbishooter.wordpress.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "intern